# This file keeps the models/ directory tracked by Git.
# The large SFace model (38MB) is excluded. See download instructions below.
#
# REQUIRED MODEL FILES:
# 1. face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx  ← included in repo (227 KB)
# 2. face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx ← DOWNLOAD MANUALLY (38 MB)
#
# Download SFace model from:
# https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/blob/main/models/face_recognition_sface/face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx
# Place it in the models/ directory before running the app.
